{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9e9b7eb01530c00b","name":"Electronet","source":{"id":"source:reference-9e9b7eb01530c00b","title":"Electronet","revision":19649,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:21:09Z","sha256":"2c9c2b9f14f28050cc65c76a9612c554cb291a18f44ea4f4d1375fc2c6055a72","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19649","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Electronet&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9e9b7eb01530c00b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Electronet is a special weapon frequently employed by bounty hunters to bring down fleeing prey. An Electronet can only be fired from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:da6a8268b875d982"},". When an Electronet is fired from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:da6a8268b875d982"},", target a 2x2 square area and make an attack roll, comparing the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of each target in the area.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If a target is hit, it takes ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage from the Electronet and is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," as per the normal rules for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Net"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Net","referenceId":"reference:660fb2c41d028988"},". Each round, at the beginning of your turn, any targets still trapped by the Electronet take ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage from the weapon at its normal amount.\n"]},{